;
; How Whetstone files a run, in MYRA (whetstone_rules.h WR6): under the
; run's number in the session, the target's place in the plan, the run's
; verdict (lpres.h: NEITHER 0, TRUE 1, FALSE 2, BOTH 3), its passed, failed
; and held counts and its milliseconds (every try summed, WR4). The model
; asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps a run.
^ZXWHET(run:i4) = target:i3! ^ verdict:i1! ^ passed:i9! ^ failed:i9! ^ held:i9! ^ ms:i8!
